  "event_preview": "Suzuka Circuit is a 5.807 km (3.608 mi), 18-turn figure-8 road course in Suzuka, Mie Prefecture, Honda's home track and the only such layout on the Super GT calendar, defined by the Degner curves, the Spoon, and 130R. Round 5 of the 2026 AUTOBACS SUPER GT Series, the Suzuka GT 300 km Race on August 22-23, is scheduled for 52 laps (301.964 km) with a 43-car grid: 14 in GT500 and 29 in GT300, both classes racing together.\n\nSho Tsuboi and Kenta Yamashita arrive as GT500 championship leaders in the No. 36 TGR Team au TOM'S GR Supra on 48 points after wins at Okayama and the Fuji 3 Hours plus fourth at the Fuji 300 km, 20 points clear of Nirei Fukuzumi and Kazuya Oshima in the No. 14 ENEOS ROOKIE Supra. Stanley Team Kunimitsu's Naoki Yamamoto and Tadasuke Makino sit third on 27 after Honda's first GT500 win of 2026 in the Prelude-GT at Fuji two weeks earlier. In GT300, Hyper Water Racing Inging's Yuui Tsutsumi and Kazuhisa Urabe are tied on 40 points with Saitama Green Brave's Hiroki Yoshida and Seita Nonaka, who won the Fuji 300 km; Kondo Racing's Joao Paulo de Oliveira and Iori Kimura are two points further back.\n\nSUPER GT qualifying records at Suzuka Circuit belong to Nirei Fukuzumi in GT500 (1:43.143, Toyota GR Supra, 2024) and Joao Paulo de Oliveira in GT300 (1:55.092, Nissan GT-R Nismo GT3, 2024).",
  "event_preview_ru": "Suzuka Circuit — шоссейный курс длиной 5,807 км (3,608 мили) с 18 поворотами в Suzuka, префектура Mie, домашняя трасса Honda и единственная «восьмёрка» в календаре Super GT: Degner, Spoon и 130R. Пятый этап AUTOBACS SUPER GT Series 2026, Suzuka GT 300 km Race 22–23 августа, запланирован на 52 круга (301,964 км) при сетке 43 машины: 14 в GT500 и 29 в GT300, оба класса едут вместе.\n\nSho Tsuboi и Kenta Yamashita приезжают лидерами GT500 на GR Supra No. 36 TGR Team au TOM'S с 48 очками после побед в Okayama и на Fuji 3 Hours и четвёртого места на Fuji 300 km, на 20 очков впереди Nirei Fukuzumi и Kazuya Oshima на ENEOS ROOKIE No. 14. Naoki Yamamoto и Tadasuke Makino из Stanley Team Kunimitsu — третьи с 27 после первой победы Honda в GT500 в сезоне 2026 на Prelude-GT две недели назад на Fuji. В GT300 Yuui Tsutsumi и Kazuhisa Urabe из Hyper Water Racing Inging делят 40 очков с Hiroki Yoshida и Seita Nonaka из Saitama Green Brave, победителями Fuji 300 km; Joao Paulo de Oliveira и Iori Kimura из Kondo Racing отстают на два очка.\n\nКвалификационные рекорды SUPER GT на Suzuka Circuit: GT500 — Nirei Fukuzumi (1:43.143, Toyota GR Supra, 2024), GT300 — Joao Paulo de Oliveira (1:55.092, Nissan GT-R Nismo GT3, 2024).",
